<section id="dance-about" class="container section about">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section__title">About</h2>
    <p>I’m an All Star lead in Minnesota. I’ve been dancing West Coast Swing
      since 2016 and teaching since 2019, first with Longhorn Westies at UT
      Austin and now at Swingesota.</p>
    <p>I teach the technical side: footwork, weight transfer, and connection,
      rather than a catalog of patterns. If you want the newest moves, I’m not
      your guy. If you have one that keeps not working and you can’t say why,
      I’d love to take it apart with you until it makes sense in your body.</p>
    <p>I teach all levels and both roles!</p>
